{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This first-person zombie-killing game features a tense and exciting atmosphere, with simple and straightforward gameplay. In various scenarios, you can use a wide range of weapons to eliminate wave after wave of approaching zombies alone, or hold out for a long enough time to defeat the continuous onslaught of zombies. Alternatively, you can easily and leisurely defeat groups of zombies in the practice mode. All these choices are up to you, allowing you to enjoy a brief moment of happiness in the battle against the zombie horde and relieve the stress in your life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo includes four maps and twelve firearms from the official version, allowing you to experience the core content of the full game quite comprehensively. If you enjoy this Demo, we welcome your support for our game. The full version offers more maps, firearms, and ongoing updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886060?t=1753237590","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886060?t=1753237590","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886060/2b78940f05a8f9e7376815c7527b00fa45359a3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753237590","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886060/2b78940f05a8f9e7376815c7527b00fa45359a3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753237590","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Game contains plasma jet effects, putrid humanoid enemies, and weapon-based elimination of humanoid targets.\u200b"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This first-person zombie-killing game features a tense and exciting atmosphere, with simple and straightforward gameplay. In various scenarios, you can use a wide range of weapons to eliminate wave after wave of approaching zombies alone, or hold out for a long enough time to defeat the continuous onslaught of zombies. Alternatively, you can easily and leisurely defeat groups of zombies in the practice mode. All these choices are up to you, allowing you to enjoy a brief moment of happiness in the battle against the zombie horde and relieve the stress in your life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo includes four maps and twelve firearms from the official version, allowing you to experience the core content of the full game quite comprehensively. If you enjoy this Demo, we welcome your support for our game. The full version offers more maps, firearms, and ongoing updates.</p>","developers":["YIxia Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3832400","name":"Keep Fire"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886060/fc633e32122bdb66f1939a72e168c771919895b7/header.jpg?t=1753237590","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257169682,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169682/movie480.mp4?t=1752890088","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169682/movie_max.mp4?t=1752890088"},"name":"promotional","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257169682/cccadfc3d696657f58aa16de67a17a5e055f27cb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752890088","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169682/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752890088","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257169682/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752890088"}}],"name":"Keep Fire Dem